sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Portal UI
    participant API as Portal API
    participant Graph as PlatformGraph
    participant FS as Shared FS
    participant Job as Domino Job (autodoc)
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant DB as Provenance DB
    participant Domino as Domino Bundle API

    User->>UI: Click "Generate" on model detail
    UI->>API: POST /api/docs/generate {bundle_id, doc_type}
    API->>Graph: Force-refresh bundle
    Graph-->>API: bundle + policy_def
    API->>API: Acquire soft lock (bundle_id, template)
    API->>FS: Write ctx_{uuid}.json
    API->>Job: Submit Domino Job (main.py --context-file ...)
    API-->>UI: 202 Accepted (job_id)

    Note over Job: SCAN → PLAN → GENERATE → BUILD → STAMP

    Job->>FS: Read ctx_{uuid}.json
    Job->>Job: derive_spec(policy_def, "mdd")

    par SCAN
        Job->>Job: Code scan (Python, ML frameworks)
    and
        Job->>Job: Artifact scan (MLflow runs, metrics)
    end

    Job->>LLM: PLAN — section prompts + bundle facts
    LLM-->>Job: Section plans (ContentBlocks)

    loop For each ContentBlock (up to 4 concurrent)
        Job->>LLM: GENERATE narrative / table / chart / list
        LLM-->>Job: Content + [@citation] markers
    end

    Job->>Job: BUILD .docx (cover, TOC, sections, footnotes)
    Job->>Job: Stamp 8-field provenance (Word custom properties)
    Job->>DB: INSERT provenance row (atomic with .docx save)

    opt AUTODOC_AUTO_FINDINGS=true
        Job->>Job: Consistency checker (gaps, declared vs detected)
    end

    Job->>FS: Write .docx and delete ctx file
    Job-->>API: Exit 0

    API->>FS: Read .docx
    API->>Domino: POST bundle attachment
    Domino-->>API: attachment_id
    API->>API: Release soft lock
    API-->>UI: Job complete (SSE / poll)
    UI-->>User: Download link + History tab updated
